  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Judah is a lion’s whelp … he couched as a lion, Gen. 49:9. he lay down as a lion, Num. 24:9. Dan is a lion’s whelp, Deut. 33:22. what is stronger than a lion, Judg. 14:18. there came a lion, and a bear, 1 Sam. 17:34. lion met him by the way, and slew him, 1 Kgs. 13:24. Lord sent lions among them, 2 Kgs. 17:25. He lieth in wait secretly as a lion in his den, Ps. 10:9. righteous are bold as a lion, Prov. 28:1. living dog is better than a dead lion, Eccl. 9:4. lion shall eat straw like the ox, Isa. 11:7 (2 Ne. 21:7; 30:13). he shall come up like a lion, Jer. 49:19. God … able to deliver thee from the lions, Dan. 6:20. My God … hath shut the lions’ mouths, Dan. 6:22. first was like a lion, and had eagle’s wings, Dan. 7:4. as a young lion to the house of Judah, Hosea 5:14. he shall roar like a lion, Hosea 11:10. as a lion among the beasts of the forest, Micah 5:8 (3 Ne. 20:16; 21:12).",
